\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar hits record low vs euro as bears push on.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Katie Hunt  \par \uc2 452 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 2004\par 14:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Nov 23 (Reuters) - The U.S. dollar resumed its downward spiral on Tuesday, lurching to a record low against the euro and hitting a nine-year low against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 News that Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may review the share of euros it holds in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves renewed speculation it might buy more euros and helped lift the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the greenback, some analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 The Russian news added to negative dollar sentiment already fuelled by market belief the U.S. is comfortable with a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reduce its current account deficit.  \par \par \uc2 "There's a bias in the market to sell dollars, and I think the story from Russia triggered (some selling)," said Aziz McMahon, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at ABN AMRO.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar fell to $1.3093 per euro by 1315 GMT, down 0.3 percent from late New York levels and reversing earlier gains made in holiday-thinned Tokyo trade.  \par \par \uc2 It was at 103.05 yen , down 0.16 percent from New York closing levels and within sight of the 4-1/2 year low of near 102.75 hit against the yen last week.  \par \par \uc2 Weakness against the yen was less pronounced due to market wariness about possible dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Asia central banks.  \par \par \uc2 "The dollar's on a downward path. The real test the market is going to face is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at some point by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said David Bloom, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at HSBC.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar hit a nine year low  against a basket \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and a\par four-month low against the pound       .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 GREENSPAN FACTOR  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan reinforced the market view that Washington wants a weaker dollar when he said on Friday the current account gap was unsustainable.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A weekend meeting of Group of 20 finance officials offered no strong measures to halt the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's decline.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The G20 communique failed to mention \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  volatility explicitly, a phrase which could have stayed dollar bears' hands for a while in anticipation of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  action, although analysts said fear of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had heightened this week.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The financial markets in Asia are starting to anticipate some impact on the real economy from \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  appreciation and that may spark \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said Steven Pearson, chief \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at Halifax Royal Bank of Scotland.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "But any \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  we do see will more likely be aimed at smoothing the dollar decline rather than halting or reversing it," Pearson added.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. home sales and the Chicago Fed National Activity Index for October are due at 1500 GMT and European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Executive Board member Gertrude Tumpel-Gugerell speaks at 1940 GMT.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041123e0bn008vm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
