\par\par \b \uc2 Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Dlr Up Vs Yen; Bush Comments Little Help -2-  \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 November 2004\par 07:40\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 With international meetings over the weekend failing to produce any signs major economies may take concerted action against the dollar's weakness, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  players are now focusing on whether and when Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  will act single-handedly to stem further rises in the yen.  \par \par \uc2 Japan's Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs Hiroshi Watanabe issued another warning shot to yen bulls Sunday, telling Dow Jones Newswires after the G20 meeting that recent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements "have been rapid and erratic, meaning this is the proper time to think of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 While Watanabe said he didn't have a specific dollar/yen level in mind that would trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , some analysts believe the MOF may step in when the dollar heads for a break of the psychologically important Y100.00 support.  \par \par \uc2 "If Bush's remarks (to Koizumi) didn't include the usual U.S. script that markets should decide \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, it could be said that Washington gave tacit approval" to yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out upon a dollar fall below Y100.00, said Yasunari Ueno, chief market economist at Mizuho Securities.  \par \par \uc2 Once Tokyo stocks begin to fall on the yen's rise, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have "justification" to conduct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Ueno said.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  