ar with investors, Takashima added.  \par \par \uc2 The 10-year Treasury note stood at 101 10/32, down 3/32 to yield 4.085% in Asian trading, slightly above the 4.07% yield at the end of trading in New York.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Stanley White, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; stanley.white@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Bennett Richardson [ 04-11-04 0628GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041104e0b40006e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
